### Register
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "kristof@example.com",
  "displayName": "kristof",
  "password": "kristof"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "kristof@example.com",
  "password": "kristof"
}

